## Reservation API note
The host exposes POST /api/role-model/track-b/replay, but it requires a durable routed capture and
candidate/budget body before it reaches ledger reservation; there is no bare reserve endpoint. The
real product replayBudgetAvailable check on the live status plus the ledger reservation regression
test are the refusal evidence used here. The harness does not fabricate a capture just to force a
budget refusal.
